# Scroll Motion (Yo-Site)

Native browser scroll + Framer Motion only. No Lenis, GSAP, or ScrollTrigger.

## Default pattern

Use `TextReveal` or `whileInView` with `once: true` and easing `[0.16, 1, 0.3, 1]`.

```jsx
<motion.div
  initial={{ opacity: 0, x: 40, scale: 0.97 }}
  whileInView={{ opacity: 1, x: 0, scale: 1 }}
  viewport={{ once: true, margin: "-100px" }}
  transition={{ duration: 0.9, ease: [0.16, 1, 0.3, 1] }}
/>
```

## Staggered cards

```jsx
viewport={{ once: true, margin: "-50px" }}
variants with delay: i * 0.12, duration: 0.8
```

## Scroll-linked parallax (desktop only, rare)

Only for CTA-style floating panels. Use `useScroll` + `useSpring` + `useTransform`.
Disable on mobile (`width < 1024`). Left Y: `[-60, 90]`, Right Y: `[90, -60]`.

## Layout

- Root: `overflow-x-hidden`
- Background: `fixed inset-0` layer behind content
- Content: `<main className="relative z-10">`

## Do not

- Add scroll libraries without explicit request
- Use `useScroll` for normal section reveals
- Skip `once: true` on viewport animations

See `scroll-motion-kit/SKILL.md` for full reference.
